# Shared schemes, generated from the `schemes:` block in project.yml. Xcode rewrites
# a scheme whenever it is used and the next `xcodegen generate` writes it back, so the
# file is never at rest. release-dmg.yml regenerates the project before it builds, and
# a fresh clone gets them from `xcodegen generate`.
